Z||000009||The Fieromaster||12-25-2001||01:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by yo_sweet:<BR><B>i hear  those mitsu motors are trash why bother? id do a nice 3800sc swap or even a quad 4<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Far from true! They actually are pretty WICKED.. Can handle about 600hp on STOCK internals... AND can make 350hp by upping boost and changing exhaust and intake!!  No lie.  They had a few problems with the 2nd gen 4g63 cause they crank walk! BUT you cant use that engine to swap cause its obdII<P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">          <FONT COLOR="red"><B>"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT></B>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">     <BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/thefieromastersig.gif">      <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AOL IM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Fastback, Black and Yellow Interior, Planning 4G63 Turbo DSM swap for it!</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
